 towers and other structures, such as rooftops (collectively, \"towers\"), (2) approximately 105,000 small cell nodes either currently generating revenue or under contract and (3) approximately 90,000 route miles of fiber primarily supporting small cells and fiber solutions. We refer to our towers, small cells and fiber assets collectively as \"communications infrastructure,\" and, at times, to our customers on our communications infrastructure as \"tenants.\" Our operating segments historically consisted of (1) Towers and (2) Fiber, which includes both small cells and fiber solutions.","zh":"我們擁有、營運和租賃分佈在美國各地的共享通訊基礎設施，包括 (1) 超過 40,000 座塔樓和其他結構，例如屋頂（統稱為「塔樓」），(2) 約 105,000 個目前正在產生收入或已簽訂合約的小型蜂窩節點，以及 (3) 約 90,000 路由的主要路由和小型蜂窩節點。我們將我們的塔、小型基地台和光纖資產統稱為“通訊基礎設施”，有時將我們通訊基礎設施上的客戶稱為“租戶”。我們的營運部門歷來由 (1) 塔式和 (2) 光纖組成，其中包括小型基地台和光纖解決方案。"},{"en":"On March 13, 2025, management signed a definitive agreement (\"Strategic Fiber Agreement\") to sell our Fiber segment, together with certain supporting assets and personnel (\"Fiber Business\"), with Zayo Group Holdings Inc. (\"Zayo\") acquiring the fiber solutions business and EQT Active Core Infrastructure fund (\"EQT\") acquiring the small cell business (\"Strategic Fiber Transaction\"). Under the agreement, we will receive $8.5 billion in aggregate, subject to certain closing adjustments. The Strategic Fiber Transaction is expected to close in the first half of 2026, subject to certain closing conditions and regulatory approvals.","zh":"2025 年 3 月 13 日，管理層簽署了一份最終協議（「策略光纖協議」），出售我們的光纖部門以及某些支援性資產和人員（「光纖業務」），Zayo Group Holdings Inc.（「Zayo」）收購光纖解決方案業務，EQT Active Core Infrastructure 基金（「EQTEQT」）。根據協議，我們將總共獲得 85 億美元，但需進行某些成交調整。戰略纖維交易預計將於 2026 年上半年完成，但須滿足某些成交條件和監管部門的批准。"},{"en":"As the aforementioned sale represents a material strategic shift for the Company, the Fiber Business' results and net assets are presented herein as discontinued operations and comparable prior periods have been recast to reflect this change. Pending the closing of the Strategic Fiber Transaction, we will continue to operate the Fiber Business in accordance with the Strategic Fiber Agreement. Following the classification of the Fiber Business as discontinued operations, the Company has one reportable segment, which is also its operating segment, that constitutes consolidated results consisting of its towers operations. Unless otherwise noted, all activities and amounts reported in this document relate to the continuing operations of the Company and exclude activities and amounts related to the Fiber Business.","zh":"由於上述出售代表了公司的重大策略轉變，纖維業務​​的業績和淨資產在本文中作為已終止經營業務和可比前期進行了重新調整，以反映這一變化。在戰略纖維交易完成之前，我們將繼續根據戰略纖維協議經營纖維業務。將纖維業務分類為已終止經營業務後，該公司有一個可報告分部，也是其經營分部，構成由塔業務組成的綜合業績。除非另有說明，本文件中報告的所有活動和金額均與公司的持續經營有關，不包括與纖維業務相關的活動和金額。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{},"peers":["AMT","SBAC","DLR","PLD","EQIX"]}}